@startuml player_update

package player {
  class Player {
    -- Fields--
    - pickupCooldown: int
    - aura: ObjAura
    - moving: boolean
    - collision: boolean
    - knockbackTimer: int
    - knockBackDx: double
    - knockBackDy: double
    - holding: boolean
    - heldBomb: ObjBomb
    - heldPot: ObjPot
    - heldRock: ObjRock
    - heldChicken: NpcChicken
    - state: PlayerState
    - spriteCounter: int
    - spriteNum: int

    -- Methods --
    + update(): void
    + updateAura(ms:int): void
    + processInput(): void
    + handleInteractInput(nearbyIndex:int): void
    + findNearbyObjectIndex(): int
    + getNearbyEntity(p:Player): Entity
    + isThrowKeyJustPressed(): boolean
    + isThrowKeyPressed(): boolean
    + startPickup(e:Entity): void
    + startPickup(index:int): void
    + finishPickup(): void
    + throwHeldBom(): void
    + throwHeldPot(): void
    + throwHeldRock(): void
    + throwHeldChicken(): void
    + startAttack(): void
    + playerAttacking(): void
    + playerGuarding(): void
    + placeBomb(): void
    + playerAttackingFireball(): void
    + updateMovement(): void
    + updateCollision(): void
    + updateAnimation(): void
    + updateTileMovement(): void
    + updateInvincibility(): void
    + resolvePenetration(): void
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getCollisionChecker(): CollisionChecker
    + getNPC(): Entity[]
    + getObj(): Entity[]
    + getMonster(): Entity[]
    + getItile(): Entity[]
    + getKeyHandler(): KeyHandler
    + getUi(): UI
    + getSoundmanager(): SoundManager
    + changeMap(tileId:int): void
    + getTileManager(): TileManager
  }
}

package collision {
  class CollisionChecker {
    + checkTile(p:Player): void
    + checkEntity(p:Player, list:Entity[]): void
  }
}

package tile {
  class TileManager {
    + getTileIdAt(x:int, y:int): int
  }
}

package object {
  class ObjBomb
  class ObjPot
  class ObjRock
  class ObjAura {
    + setWorldX(x:int): void
    + setWorldY(y:int): void
    + setMapId(id:int): void
    + activate(durationMs:long): void
  }
}

package npc {
  class NpcChicken
}

package ui {
  class UI {
    + getDamagePopupManager(): DamagePopupManager
  }
  class DamagePopupManager
}

package key {
  class KeyHandler
}

Player --> GameWindow : uses
Player --> collision.CollisionChecker : uses
Player --> tile.TileManager : uses
Player --> object.ObjBomb : may hold
Player --> object.ObjPot : may hold
Player --> object.ObjRock : may hold
Player --> object.ObjAura : uses
Player --> npc.NpcChicken : may hold
Player --> key.KeyHandler : uses
Player --> ui.UI : uses

note right of Player
**Notes**
- pickupCooldown と aura を更新する
- pickupCooldown をデクリメントし、aura の状態とタイマーを更新する。
- moving と collision をリセットし、衝突判定を実行する
- 移動フラグと衝突フラグをクリアし、タイル、NPC、オブジェクト、モンスター、インタラクティブタイルに対して衝突判定を実行する。
- 近接オブジェクトを検出する
- 近接オブジェクトのインデックスを見つけ、近接エンティティ参照を解決する（findNearbyObjectIndex / getNearbyEntity)
- 瞬間的な投げ／拾いキーを処理する
- 投げ／拾いキーの瞬間押下時に、所持状態に応じて startPickup を呼ぶか投げ処理を実行する。
- invincibility の更新

- Update pickupCooldown and aura
- Decrement pickupCooldown and update the aura state/timer.
- Reset moving and collision, then run collision checks
- Clear the movement flag and collision flag, then perform collision checks for tiles, NPCs, objects, monsters, and interactive tiles.
- Detect nearby objects
- Find nearby object index and resolve a nearby entity reference (findNearbyObjectIndex / getNearbyEntity).
- Handle instant throw/pickup key
- On the momentary throw/pickup key press, invoke startPickup or perform throw logic depending on holding state.
- changeMap and update aura world position / mapId
- Call changeMap with the current tile ID and update the aura’s world coordinates and map identifier.
- Knockback priority handling
- If knockbackTimer > 0, apply per-frame displacement, decrement the timer, and call resolvePenetration when knockback ends.
- Update invincibility and cooldowns
- Advance invincibility counters and decrement bomb/fire cooldowns.
- If attacking or guarding, run attack/guard routines
- Call startAttack/startGuard and execute the corresponding attack or guard handling.
- Process input and interaction
- Run general input processing and handle interaction/enter input (processInput and handleInteractInput).
- PICKUP / HOLD_WALK state handling
- Advance pickup animation frames or keep held entities (bomb, pot, rock, chicken) positioned above the player while held.
- If moving, update movement, collision, animation, and tile movement — Execute updateMovement, updateCollision, updateAnimation, and updateTileMovement when the moving flag is set.
- Update invincibility state
- Finalize invincibility-related updates (timers, transparency, and flag resets).
end note

note left of GameWindow
  GameWindow は CollisionChecker, TileManager, UI, SoundManager, 各種エンティティ配列へのアクセサを提供する。
end note
@enduml